      "name": "salt-free seasoning blend",
      "amount": "1 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "candy corn",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "low-sodium alternative to traditional candy"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant",
    "Add the cornmeal and cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly",
    "Add the water, dried oregano, and salt-free seasoning blend, and bring to a boil",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes, until the liquid is absorbed",
    "Stir in the candy corn and cook for an additional 2 minutes",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley if desired"
